If "%0" = "" Then Echo Makatic.RunLMakes: Usage:
If "%0" = "" Then Echo Makatic.RunLMakes |<build-type> [|<library directory>]
If "%0" = "" Then Obey

Wimpslot 640k

Echo Makatic.RunLMakes started...

<Obey$Dir>._EnsureLib %1

Show Makatic$LibDir

Echo Building '%0' makefiles for '<Makatic$LibDir>'.
Every.Every2 -e <Makatic$LibDir>.Libraries.*.%0.Makefile Amu -desktop -f %%0
Unset Makatic$LibDir
Echo Makatic.RunLMakes finished.
